  "goodToKnow": "Das Debakel is a debacle or fiasco: ein Wahldebakel, ein sportliches Debakel. In football, Brazil's 1–7 defeat by Germany in the 2014 World Cup semi-final is remembered in Brazil as the Mineiraço, while Germany's own Debakel came at the 2018 World Cup. Synonyms: die Pleite, das Fiasko, die Blamage. From French débâcle (breaking up of ice). Plural: die Debakel."
